      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """At the ops-readiness review, [a demand for dates plus a commitment that a soak doesn't get shortened because a date slipped](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_28) was met with [an agreement to hold it](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_29).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """At the cutover review the author [retracted the two-week figure outright](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_3), having [re-analyzed the logs and found the nine-day flattening was an artifact of a retired weekly reconciliation job](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_5) — [nothing in the new platform runs on a weekly cycle](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_7).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """The revised basis is [one week: underlying exception rate flat by day four, plus three days of margin](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_9), formally [ratified on the record as superseding the earlier note](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20).""" ]
